      "outputs": [],
      "title": "START HERE — Clip 1 / Flexible H3 Start",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# H3 Infinite v1.4 — Start Workflow\n\nUse this workflow to create **Clip 1**. The flexible Start conditioning remains the same as v1.3; the major v1.4 change happens when Clip 2+ is continued with native Masked AV.\n\n**Important:** v1.4 continuation requires **a current ComfyUI build containing native PR #15375 H3 AV-mask support** because it uses the native MiniMax H3 per-stream denoise-mask support. Update ComfyUI and restart before testing v1.4.\n\n1. Select the H3 FL2VA model, Qwen encoder, Video VAE and Audio VAE.\n2. Connect any combination of **First Frame**, **Last Frame** and optional **Qwen References**.\n3. Enter prompt, resolution and duration.\n4. Queue. The full generated AV latent is saved, while Auto Handover analyzes only the rendered tail for later freeze trimming.\n5. Use the v1.4 **Native Masked AV Continue** workflow for Clip 2+.\n\n### First / Last Frames remain optional\n- **T2VA:** no First / no Last\n- **I2VA:** First only\n- **L2VA:** Last only\n- **FL2VA:** First + Last\n\nFor long FL2VA chains, repeated Last Frames are still recommended as visual endpoints / **quality resets**."
      ],
      "color": "#1f4d3b",
      "bgcolor": "#2c6b52"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
